WEBVTT

00:04:28.634 --> 00:04:33.218
per te ngritur ne altar 
te ashtuquajturin nder.

00:04:33.218 --> 00:04:34.752
Dhe ka edhe nje norme tjeter

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:37.110
te shoqerive patriarkale

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.560
qe quhet bindje.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.346
Nje vajze e mire supozohet te jete

00:04:45.346 --> 00:04:50.594
shume e urte, shume e perulur

00:04:50.594 --> 00:04:54.565
dhe shume e nenshtruar.

00:04:54.565 --> 00:04:55.904
Ky eshte kriteri.

00:04:55.904 --> 00:04:59.736
Vajza e mire model duhet te jete 
shume e urte.

00:04:59.736 --> 00:05:02.025
Ajo supozohet te jete e heshtur